ges":"English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese","reviews":"“It’s absolutely adorable and it’s got a neat gimmick, but it doesn’t just rest on those things to try to sell itself – it has gameplay that really delivers, too. It’s a neat, ambitious combination that’s a must-play for any platforming fan.”<br>95\/100 – Gaming Age<br><br>“Dodo Duckie is exactly the kind of surprise that reminds you why smaller independent games continue to thrive.”<br>4\/5 – Game Critix<br><br>“Dodo Duckie is a pleasant surprise in the platforming game scene. By making the alternation between 2D and 3D perspectives the foundation of its level design, the title delivers ingenious puzzles and a calibrated learning curve.”<br>95\/100 – GameBlast<br>","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3358170\/a5c63fced6dfd9f0a83650eb35332f0058636405\/header.jpg?t=1795677228","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3358170\/0e8281c6c3ebacd6ce1e99cd3b7a3380695dbfad\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1795677228","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3358170\/0e8281c6c3ebacd6ce1e99cd3b7a3380695dbfad\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1795677228","website":"https:\/\/bornmonkie.com","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 x64 Bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i5-9400F \/ AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1660 (6 GB) \/ AMD Radeon RX 580 (8 GB)<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 12<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 7 GB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> Low Quality setting, 1080p, producing 45 FPS, SSD Required<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recom